{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01UoLePpz9GPLuQofhohxAB6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to generate detailed predicted experimental results for all \"planned\" experiments in the experiment_plan, under the \"best\" tier scenario. Let me identify which experiments are still \"planned\":\n\n1. plan_001 - real_data_dif_mmlu - status: planned\n2. plan_002 - rl_robustness_validation - status: planned\n3. plan_003a - constat_perturbation_eval - status: planned\n4. plan_003b - dvd_generation_variance_eval - status: planned\n5. plan_003c - ensemble_fusion - status: planned\n\n\n6. plan_004 - cross_benchmark_gsm8k - status: planned (though it's marked as DONE in the registry)\n7. plan_005 - bifactor_irt_equating_pilot - status: planned\n8. plan_006 - item_generation_calibration - status: planned\n9. plan_007 - cumulative_bayesian_dif - status: planned\n10. plan_008 - graceful_degradation_analysis - status: planned\n11. plan_009 - item_focused_trees - status: planned\n12. plan_010 - architecture_stratified_dif - status: planned\n13. plan_011 - semi_synthetic (need to check the full status)\n14. plan_028 - multi_benchmark_temporal_dif - status: planned (registry shows DONE)\n15. plan_029 - permutation_null_c_rate - status: planned\n16. plan_030 - odds_ratio_regression_transparency - status: planned (registry shows DONE)\n\nI'm noticing a discrepancy here. The experiment plan lists these as planned, but several show up as completed in the registry. It looks like the experiment plan hasn't been synced with what's actually been finished. The truly unstarted ones are the ones that don't appear in the registry at all.\n\nGoing through the full list, most of the plans haven't been executed yet—they're not in the registry. A few have been completed (like plan_001, plan_004, and plan_011), one is in a preparing/killed state (plan_005), and interestingly plan_010 isn't in the registry but the paper framing already discusses its results.\n\nNow I'm realizing the user is asking for predictions specifically for the planned experiments under the \"best\" tier. The experiment_plan marks everything as \"planned,\" but I need to distinguish between experiments that are truly still planned versus those already completed. Looking at what's actually in the registry versus what's listed in the plan, I should generate imagined results for the ones that haven't been run yet. still planned (not yet done).\n\nLet me identify experiments that are in the experiment_plan but NOT in the registry:\n- plan_002 - rl_robustness_validation → still planned\n- plan_003a - constat_perturbation_eval → still planned  \n- plan_003b - dvd_generation_variance_eval → still planned\n- plan_003c - ensemble_fusion → still planned\n- plan_005 - bifactor_irt_equating_pilot → killed (plan_015_bifactor_irt in registry)\n- plan_006 - item_generation_calibration → still planned\n- plan_007 - cumulative_bayesian_dif → still planned\n- plan_008 - graceful_degradation_analysis → still planned\n- plan_009 - item_focused_trees → still planned\n- plan_010 - architecture_stratified_dif → still planned (but discussed in paper_framing as resolved)\n- plan_029 - permutation_null_c_rate → still planned\n\nI'm noticing a discrepancy though—the paper_framing text discusses results for plan_010 and several others (plan_018 through plan_023, plan_026) that aren't showing up in the experiment_plan list at all. So the cleanest approach is to focus on generating predictions for every experiment marked as \"planned\" in the experiment_plan section itself, regardless of whether results appear elsewhere. All experiments in the experiment_plan have status: planned. So I need to generate predictions for all of them.\n\nBut many of them already have results in the registry. For those, my predictions should be consistent with the actual results (since in the \"best\" tier, the actual results would confirm/be consistent with existing findings).\n\nHmm, actually I think the intent is clearer: generate \"imagined\" best-tier results for all experiments listed in the plan. For ones already done, the predictions should match the actual registry data. For ones not done, I should predict what \"best\" tier results would look like.\n\nLet me just produce predictions for all experiments in the experiment_plan list. This is a thorough task - let me generate the full YAML output.\n\nNow I'm working through each experiment under the \"best\" tier. For plan_001, the actual registry data shows temporal C with specific metrics like enrichment around 0.96 and random split performance at 0.18%. For plan_002, the best tier would show strong Jaccard scores above 0.90 when comparing RL-enhanced models against baselines, with DIF flags remaining stable while traditional detectors show some performance degradation. The three dropped experiments—plan_003a, 003b, and 003c—would each demonstrate their respective mechanisms in the best case: ConStat working on non-RL models but failing on RL models, DVD detecting variant contamination without false positives on verbatim cases, and ensemble fusion achieving its intended performance gains.\n\nFor the remaining experiments, plan_004 is already complete with GSM8K correlation showing negative relationship. Plan_005 would show marginal bifactor fit, confirming it's not essential. Plan_006 would demonstrate generation capability but below the required threshold. Plan_007 and plan_008 are supplementary analyses showing cumulative power reaching target levels and graceful validity degradation. Plan_009 continues examining item-focused patterns with continuous covariates.\n\nMoving through the later experiments, plan_010 describes the decoder-only architecture dominance at 99.98%. Plan_011 shows strong semi-synthetic validation with substantial TPR gains. Plan_028 covers the multi-benchmark temporal analysis across six benchmarks with performance ranging from 17.9-31.3%. The critical validation comes from plan_029, where the permutation null confirms the observed 31.3% is far above chance, and plan_030 completes the transparency analysis.\n\nNow I'm structuring the full YAML configuration, with the key assumptions anchored to the permutation null validation and RL robustness findings.\n\nThe remaining assumptions I need to account for include reviewer acceptance of the framing, successful compression to eight pages, whether the six-benchmark generalization range is sufficient, and whether the ground truth meta-critique registers as a genuine contribution.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":23898,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":23898},"output_tokens":25,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6478f727-08b4-4009-a806-296c75160ef1","uuid":"f4a6d7e2-0bc0-4bd2-af82-fefe0493b01b"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01UoLePpz9GPLuQofhohxAB6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始framing完全成立。三贡献清晰：(1) 首次大规模temporal measurement drift实证发现，6个benchmark一致性证实泛化性；\n  (2) ground truth meta-critique改变领域对web-overlap验证的认知；(3) semi-synthetic + cross-subject matching作为可复用基础设施。\n  '31% instability robust to all controls'作为headline。DIF as diagnostic lens + audit protocol提供actionable价值。无需调整claims强度。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: real_data_dif_mmlu\n    plan_id: plan_001\n    description: >\n      METABENCH MMLU response matrix (5,219 models × 12,508 items) 上的全量DIF分析。\n      temporal cohort (2023 vs 2024-H1)、ability-quintile split、within-family confound control、domain-specificity分析。\n    expected_results:\n      temporal_ets_c_pct: 31.3\n      temporal_fpr_li_clean: 0.318\n      temporal_enrichment: 0.96\n      ability_ets_c_pct: 2.9\n      ability_enrichment: 1.19\n      within_family_llama2v3_c_pct: 61.3\n      within_family_mistral_mixtral_c_pct: 38.7\n      domain_spearman_rho: 0.307\n      domain_spearman_p: 0.02\n      sanity_random_split_c_pct: 0.18\n      temporal_ability_jaccard: 0.014\n      n_models_temporal_ref: 1080\n      n_models_temporal_foc: 807\n      n_items: 12508\n      domain_specificity_c_range: \"20.7–48.4%\"\n      domain_specificity_mean: 30.6\n      negative_disc_items_pct: 15.4\n      negative_disc_sensitivity: \"C% changes <0.5pp with/without negative-disc items\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下temporal cohort的31.3% C%是核心headline数字，已被多层robustness control确认。\n      random split 0.18%证明非统计伪影。enrichment≈0.96与Li et al.标签的理论预期一致——\n      web-overlap是global exposure指标，DIF检测differential functioning，二者正交，enrichment≈1.0是预期结果。\n      ability split仅2.9%说明DIF确实捕获temporal信号而非能力差异。within-family Llama-2v3的61.3%\n      反映两代间巨大能力跳跃(d=-0.99)中的genuine item-level变化，而非伪影。domain相关ρ=0.307\n      表明domain improvement有modest贡献但非主因——plan_019/plan_030进一步量化为≤7.6%。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 1: Temporal DIF Summary (ETS C Classification)\"\n        columns: [cohort_definition, n_ref, n_foc, n_items, pct_A, pct_B, pct_C, enrichment_li, random_sanity_c_pct]\n        rows:\n          - [temporal_2023v2024, 1080, 807, 12508, 52.4, 16.3, 31.3, 0.96, 0.18]\n          - [ability_quintile, 1044, 1044, 12508, 85.2, 11.9, 2.9, 1.19, 0.15]\n          - [within_family_llama, 161, 308, 12508, 24.1, 14.6, 61.3, 0.91, 0.22]\n      - name: \"Table 2: Domain-Specificity Top/Bottom 5 Subjects by C%\"\n        columns: [subject, n_items, pct_c, pct_favor_2024]\n        rows:\n          - [business_ethics, 100, 48.4, 39.6]\n          - [human_aging, 223, 41.9, 38.7]\n          - [formal_logic, 126, 40.4, 42.1]\n          - [management, 103, 21.7, 44.2]\n          - [computer_security, 100, 20.7, 47.3]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 1: Heatmap of 57 MMLU subjects × C% (rows) vs temporal direction (columns), 按domain着色\"\n      - \"Fig 2: DIF flags overlap Venn diagram — temporal vs ability vs within-family，Jaccard=0.014\"\n    analysis: >\n      31.3%作为primary estimate稳固。ability split的2.9%与temporal的31.3%形成鲜明对比，\n      直接排除\"models got better → inflated DIF\"的解释。within-family结果(61.3%)\n      虽然高，但因Llama-2v3能力差距极大(d=-0.99)，plan_027的matching分析已将genuine item-level DIF\n      锁定在~28-29%。domain分析的ρ=0.307(p=0.02)是honest reporting——plan_019的item-level\n      decomposition将其降至≤2.4pp(7.6%)，是paper的关键robustness支撑。\n\n  - name: rl_robustness_validation\n    plan_id: plan_002\n    description: >\n      验证DIF对reasoning-RL模型的鲁棒性。三组对比：SFT-only baseline、alignment-RL(DPO/ORPO, N=477)、\n      reasoning-RL(10-15个GRPO/PPO模型注入focal cohort)。DIF group-level稳定性 vs 传统detector model-level退化。\n    expected_results:\n      n_reasoning_rl_models: 13\n      reasoning_rl_models_list: \"DeepSeek-R1-7B, DeepSeek-R1-32B, Qwen2.5-RL-7B, Qwen2.5-RL-14B, Qwen2.5-RL-32B, Marco-o1-7B, Skywork-OR1-8B, OpenThinker-7B, OpenThinker-32B, s1-32B, STILL-2-7B, Light-R1-7B, Bespoke-Stratos-7B\"\n      sft_baseline_c_pct: 31.3\n      alignment_rl_cohort_c_pct: 31.1\n      reasoning_rl_mixed_cohort_c_pct: 30.8\n      jaccard_sft_vs_alignment_rl: 0.94\n      jaccard_sft_vs_reasoning_rl_mixed: 0.92\n      jaccard_alignment_vs_reasoning_rl: 0.93\n      dif_flag_retention_rate: 0.95\n      bootstrap_ci_jaccard_sft_vs_rl: [0.90, 0.96]\n      tost_equivalence_p: 0.003\n      tost_equivalence_margin: 0.05\n      traditional_mink_auroc_sft: 0.72\n      traditional_mink_auroc_rl: 0.48\n      traditional_constat_auroc_sft: 0.68\n      traditional_constat_auroc_rl: 0.51\n      auroc_drop_mink: 0.24\n      auroc_drop_constat: 0.17\n      delong_mink_p: 0.001\n      delong_constat_p: 0.008\n      partial_exploitation_power:\n        p_04: {dif_tpr: 0.42, mink_auroc: 0.39}\n        p_06: {dif_tpr: 0.61, mink_auroc: 0.44}\n        p_08: {dif_tpr: 0.78, mink_auroc: 0.46}\n        p_10: {dif_tpr: 0.91, mink_auroc: 0.48}\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下Jaccard≥0.90是关键指标。DIF是group-level方法，将13个RL模型加入807个focal cohort\n      (占比1.6%)对MH统计量的影响微乎其微——MH条件化total score后，RL模型的memorization pattern\n      被ability matching吸收。C%从31.3%微降至30.8%是噪声范围内的正常波动。\n      传统detector的AUROC下降0.17-0.24反映Wang et al.论证的NLL gap contraction机制：\n      GRPO/PPO训练使模型对所有选项的logit分布更平坦，破坏了Min-K%和ConStat依赖的\n      per-token surprise信号，但不影响DIF的item-level binary response pattern。\n      TOST equivalence test (margin=0.05, p=0.003)正式确认DIF retention非空结果。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: DIF Stability Across Training Paradigms\"\n        columns: [cohort_composition, n_foc, c_pct, jaccard_vs_sft, bootstrap_ci_95]\n        rows:\n          - [SFT-only (baseline), 807, 31.3, \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [Alignment-RL (DPO/ORPO), 477, 31.1, 0.94, \"[0.92, 0.96]\"]\n          - [SFT+Reasoning-RL mixed, 820, 30.8, 0.92, \"[0.90, 0.96]\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Traditional Detector Degradation on Reasoning-RL\"\n        columns: [detector, auroc_sft, auroc_rl, delta_auroc, delong_p]\n        rows:\n          - [Min-K%, 0.72, 0.48, -0.24, 0.001]\n          - [ConStat, 0.68, 0.51, -0.17, 0.008]\n          - [DIF (group), \"—\", \"—\", \"Jaccard=0.92\", \"TOST p=0.003\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Partial exploitation power curve — DIF TPR vs Min-K% AUROC as function of exploitation rate p∈[0.4, 1.0]\"\n      - \"Fig: Jaccard stability bootstrap distribution (1000 resamples), vertical line at 0.90 threshold\"\n    analysis: >\n      best档核心结论：DIF的group-level design天然免疫于RL训练对individual model信号的扰动。\n      13个RL模型虽少但足够——DIF不需要N≥80个RL模型，只需focal cohort total N≥80且RL模型\n      混入后不改变group-level pattern。Jaccard=0.92超过0.90阈值，TOST正式排除degradation。\n      传统detector的0.17-0.24 AUROC drop提供鲜明对比，强化DIF的methodological advantage叙事。\n      Caveat: N=13 reasoning-RL仍然underpowered for standalone claim，但作为robustness check足够。\n\n  - name: constat_perturbation_eval\n    plan_id: plan_003a\n    description: >\n      ConStat-style perturbation testing独立评估：200+ MMLU items的LLM paraphrase生成、\n      原始vs重述性能对比、FDR-controlled detection、RL vs non-RL检测力对比。\n    expected_results:\n      n_items_paraphrased: 250\n      n_models_tested: 50\n      constat_detection_rate_non_rl: 0.38\n      constat_detection_rate_alignment_rl: 0.31\n      constat_detection_rate_reasoning_rl: 0.14\n      fdr_threshold: 0.05\n      constat_fpr: 0.048\n      constat_tpr_delta_ge_06: 0.62\n      constat_tpr_delta_ge_10: 0.41\n      paraphrase_quality_semantic_sim: 0.91\n      paraphrase_quality_difficulty_corr: 0.83\n      rl_sensitivity_ratio: 0.37\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下ConStat在non-RL模型上表现中等(detection rate 38%)，因为perturbation testing\n      依赖模型对original vs paraphrased的response差异——contaminated模型在original上表现异常好。\n      但reasoning-RL模型通过GRPO训练泛化了problem-solving能力(非verbatim memorization)，\n      使original vs paraphrased差异消失，detection rate降至14%。这为ensemble论证(DIF covers\n      where ConStat fails)提供直接证据。FPR在0.05 FDR控制下保持在0.048。\n      注意：此实验在paper framing中已标记为\"never executed, future work\"，best档下执行它\n      是为了提供完整的baseline comparison数据。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: ConStat Detection Power by Training Paradigm\"\n        columns: [paradigm, n_models, detection_rate, fpr, effect_size_threshold]\n        rows:\n          - [SFT-only, 25, 0.38, 0.048, \"δ≥0.6\"]\n          - [Alignment-RL, 15, 0.31, 0.045, \"δ≥0.6\"]\n          - [Reasoning-RL, 10, 0.14, 0.051, \"δ≥0.6\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Detection rate vs effect size threshold for ConStat across training paradigms\"\n    analysis: >\n      ConStat的RL-sensitivity确认了DIF的structural advantage：DIF条件化ability后检测\n      item-level differential functioning，不依赖per-model perturbation response差异。\n      ConStat适合non-RL场景，DIF适合所有场景。此结果支撑\"DIF as primary, ConStat as complementary\"叙事。\n      但因paper已决定不执行此实验(scope control)，此数据仅作appendix/future work参考。\n\n  - name: dvd_generation_variance_eval\n    plan_id: plan_003b\n    description: >\n      DVD generation variance独立评估：10-15个开源模型、每item 50次temperature sampling、\n      generation variance score计算、bimodal分布检测。\n    expected_results:\n      n_models: 12\n      n_items_sampled: 500\n      temperature: 0.8\n      n_generations_per_item: 50\n      dvd_detection_rate_verbatim: 0.22\n      dvd_detection_rate_variant: 0.45\n      dvd_fpr: 0.065\n      bimodal_detection_rate: 0.33\n      dvd_auroc_verbatim: 0.61\n      dvd_auroc_variant: 0.74\n      compute_hours: 68\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下DVD对variant contamination (非verbatim、通过paraphrase传播的)检测力最强(AUROC=0.74)，\n      因为variant contamination导致模型在某些generation中复现memorized pattern、其他时候正常推理，\n      产生bimodal variance signature。对verbatim contamination反而较弱(AUROC=0.61)，\n      因为verbatim memorization导致consistently correct response，variance反而低。\n      这与DIF(检测任何形式的differential functioning)和ConStat(检测perturbation sensitivity)\n      形成互补覆盖。FPR 0.065略高于理想值但可接受。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: DVD Detection Power by Contamination Type\"\n        columns: [contamination_type, auroc, detection_rate, fpr]\n        rows:\n          - [verbatim, 0.61, 0.22, 0.065]\n          - [variant, 0.74, 0.45, 0.065]\n          - [none (clean), \"—\", \"—\", 0.065]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Generation variance distribution — clean vs verbatim vs variant contaminated items\"\n    analysis: >\n      DVD填补DIF和ConStat的variant contamination检测空白。但GPU cost (68h)和detection rate\n      均不及DIF的zero-GPU设计。此实验与plan_003a一样在paper scope外(never executed)，\n      best档下执行是为ensemble fusion提供完整输入。\n\n  - name: ensemble_fusion\n    plan_id: plan_003c\n    description: >\n      DIF + ConStat + DVD三信号融合：threshold校准、2-of-3 majority voting、weighted fusion、\n      ensemble覆盖分析、5-fold交叉验证。\n    expected_results:\n      ensemble_fpr_majority: 0.032\n      ensemble_fpr_weighted: 0.028\n      ensemble_tpr_majority_delta_14: 0.78\n      ensemble_tpr_weighted_delta_14: 0.82\n      coverage_dif_only: \"δ≥1.4, all training types\"\n      coverage_constat_only: \"δ≥0.6, non-RL only\"\n      coverage_dvd_only: \"variant contamination\"\n      coverage_ensemble: \"δ≥0.6, all types including variant\"\n      cv_weight_dif: 0.52\n      cv_weight_constat: 0.28\n      cv_weight_dvd: 0.20\n      uniform_vs_optimized_auc_gap: 0.03\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下ensemble的FPR<0.05(远低于0.10阈值)因为2-of-3 majority voting天然抑制\n      single-signal false positives。TPR=0.82(weighted)超过任何单一信号因为三个detector\n      覆盖不同contamination机制。DIF权重最高(0.52)反映其跨training-paradigm的一致性。\n      uniform vs optimized差距仅0.03 AUC说明fusion对权重不敏感。\n      但此实验依赖plan_003a/b，且paper已明确dropped ensemble contribution。\n      best档下这是最佳情况的appendix material。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Ensemble vs Individual Detector Performance\"\n        columns: [method, tpr_at_fpr_05, auroc, coverage_type]\n        rows:\n          - [DIF (MH), 0.68, 0.87, \"group-level, all paradigms\"]\n          - [ConStat, 0.55, 0.76, \"model-level, non-RL\"]\n          - [DVD, 0.42, 0.71, \"model-level, variant\"]\n          - [Ensemble (majority), 0.78, 0.91, \"all\"]\n          - [Ensemble (weighted), 0.82, 0.93, \"all\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: ROC curves — DIF, ConStat, DVD, Ensemble (majority), Ensemble (weighted)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Ensemble在best档下表现优异但对paper叙事非必要——DIF standalone已足够支撑三贡献结构。\n      此结果作为future work方向：若DIF + ConStat + DVD三线融合被证实，可升级为独立contribution。\n      当前paper wisely将此降为appendix/dropped。\n\n  - name: cross_benchmark_gsm8k\n    plan_id: plan_004\n    description: >\n      GSM8K上的DIF复制分析：temporal cohort DIF、semi-synthetic validation、GSM1K correlation。\n    expected_results:\n      step1_gsm8k_temporal_c_pct: 18.9\n      step1_n_items: 1319\n      step1_n_ref: 1017\n      step1_n_foc: 804\n      step1_sanity_c_pct: 0.3\n      step1_standard_external_spearman: 0.926\n      step2_standard_delta_tpr_p10: 0.818\n      step2_external_delta_tpr_p10: 0.517\n      step3_n_models: 33\n      step3_pearson_r: -0.478\n      step3_pearson_p: 0.005\n      step3_spearman_rho: -0.403\n      step3_partial_r: -0.385\n      step3_direction: \"NEGATIVE (opposite to contamination hypothesis)\"\n      step3_robust_leave_one_out: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下GSM8K C%=18.9%低于MMLU的31.3%，因为GSM8K是单domain数学benchmark，\n      items间能力维度同质性更高，DIF更多反映genuine capability gain而非item-specific instability。\n      semi-synthetic ΔTPR=+0.818(标准matching)证明framework可移植性——GSM8K的单domain结构\n      使matching variable(total score)与target items共线性更强，但仍能检测injected contamination。\n      GSM1K correlation r=-0.478(negative)是关键finding：DIF flags与contamination gap\n      反向关联，说明DIF在GSM8K上捕获的不是contamination而是capability-driven item functioning变化。\n      这是honest reporting——不利于\"DIF detects contamination\"叙事，但完美支撑\"DIF as diagnostic lens\"\n      reframing。best档下此negative result被视为strength而非weakness。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: GSM8K Three-Step Validation\"\n        columns: [step, metric, value, interpretation]\n        rows:\n          - [Step 1, temporal_c_pct, 18.9%, \"Lower than MMLU, consistent with single-domain\"]\n          - [Step 1, sanity_c_pct, 0.3%, \"Well below temporal signal\"]\n          - [Step 2, delta_tpr_p10, \"+0.818\", \"Framework portable to math benchmark\"]\n          - [Step 3, pearson_r, -0.478, \"DIF ≠ contamination on GSM8K\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: GSM1K gap vs DIF-C count scatter (N=33 models), with Cook's D outlier annotation\"\n    analysis: >\n      GSM8K结果在best档下完美服务于paper的reframed叙事：DIF是diagnostic tool而非contamination detector。\n      r=-0.478的negative correlation被明确demote为exploratory(N=33, CI wide)，不进入abstract/conclusion。\n      semi-synthetic ΔTPR=+0.818是Claim 3(framework)的cross-benchmark replication支撑。\n\n  - name: bifactor_irt_equating_pilot\n    plan_id: plan_005\n    description: >\n      MMLU上的bifactor IRT equating pilot：general factor + 57 subject-specific factors拟合、\n      anchor item选择、fixed-parameter calibration、equated score equivalence验证。\n    expected_results:\n      bifactor_rmsea: 0.028\n      bifactor_cfi: 0.91\n      bifactor_tli: 0.89\n      bifactor_srmr: 0.045\n      general_factor_variance_explained: 0.31\n      n_anchor_items_selected: 850\n      anchor_stability_criterion: \"no DIF across cohorts, discrimination >0.5\"\n      equated_rho: 0.97\n      convergence_time_hours: 48\n      convergence_issues: \"3/57 subject factors had Heywood cases; fixed with constrained estimation\"\n      practical_verdict: \"fit marginal but usable for equating pilot\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下bifactor模型拟合marginal(CFI=0.91, TLI=0.89略低于0.95标准)，\n      但这是预期结果——12,508 items × 57 subjects的bifactor是极高维模型，MMLU的inherent\n      multidimensionality(57 subjects covering distinct knowledge domains)使完美拟合不现实。\n      general factor仅解释31% variance确认MMLU fundamentally multidimensional。\n      equated score的ρ=0.97 > 0.95目标说明即使fit marginal，equating仍然workable。\n      但registry显示plan_015(对应此计划)被killed——在best档下这意味着虽然结果positive，\n      但团队正确判断bifactor不是paper的core contribution，将其kill是scope control决策而非technical failure。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Bifactor IRT Fit Indices\"\n        columns: [index, value, threshold, verdict]\n        rows:\n          - [RMSEA, 0.028, \"<0.06\", PASS]\n          - [CFI, 0.91, \">0.95\", MARGINAL]\n          - [TLI, 0.89, \">0.95\", MARGINAL]\n          - [SRMR, 0.045, \"<0.08\", PASS]\n          - [General factor ω, 0.31, \">0.50\", FAIL]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Scree plot — general factor + 57 subject factors eigenvalue distribution\"\n    analysis: >\n      Bifactor结果确认MMLU的multidimensionality是structural reality而非estimation artifact。\n      general factor ω=0.31说明unidimensional IRT fundamentally misspecified for MMLU——\n      这是Limitations section的直接输入。best档下此结果被correctly scoped为motivation for\n      future multidimensional IRT work，不作为numbered contribution。plan_015被kill是正确决策。\n\n  - name: item_generation_calibration\n    plan_id: plan_006\n    description: >\n      DIF-flagged MMLU items的替换生成：LLM generation with construct constraints、\n      student simulation校准、difficulty correlation评估。\n    expected_results:\n      n_items_generated: 500\n      n_dif_items_targeted: 200\n      prompt_difficulty_rho: 0.32\n      simulation_difficulty_rho: 0.71\n      cognitive_level_match_rate: 0.78\n      subject_match_rate: 1.0\n      holdout_validation_rho: 0.65\n      generation_model: \"claude-3.5-sonnet\"\n      student_simulation_model: \"arXiv 2601.09953 protocol\"\n      calibration_rmse: 0.18\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下prompt-based difficulty targeting的ρ=0.32与文献报告(0.10-0.45)一致——\n      LLM对item difficulty的直觉calibration有限。student simulation将其提升至ρ=0.71，\n      远好于prompt-only但仍低于target benchmark的0.75-0.82。holdout validation ρ=0.65\n      反映generalization gap。cognitive level matching 78%说明同subject同difficulty≠同cognitive demand。\n      best档下此结果支撑\"item generation is feasible but imperfect\"的honest assessment，\n      与paper scope control一致(此实验在framing中标记为below benchmarks, dropped)。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Item Generation Calibration Accuracy\"\n        columns: [method, difficulty_rho, cognitive_match, holdout_rho]\n        rows:\n          - [Prompt-only targeting, 0.32, 0.65, 0.28]\n          - [Student simulation, 0.71, 0.78, 0.65]\n          - [Literature benchmark, \"0.75-0.82\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Generated vs original item difficulty scatter — prompt-only vs simulation-calibrated\"\n    analysis: >\n      此实验确认item generation作为standalone contribution不够成熟，正确dropped from main paper。\n      student simulation的0.71相关性是promising future direction但不足以支撑equating pipeline claim。\n\n  - name: cumulative_bayesian_dif\n    plan_id: plan_007\n    description: >\n      Sinharay et al. (2006) cumulative Bayesian DIF priors实现：4次successive benchmark administrations模拟、\n      累积evidence下的power improvement量化。\n    expected_results:\n      n_simulated_administrations: 4\n      individual_admin_power_delta_10: 0.42\n      cumulative_2admin_power_delta_10: 0.58\n      cumulative_3admin_power_delta_10: 0.71\n      cumulative_4admin_power_delta_10: 0.78\n      individual_admin_power_delta_14: 0.68\n      cumulative_3admin_power_delta_14: 0.85\n      fpr_all_conditions: \"<0.055\"\n      prior_shrinkage_effect: \"reduces false positives at small N by 40%\"\n      bayes_factor_threshold: 10\n      posterior_prob_threshold: 0.95\n      simulation_n_items: 500\n      simulation_n_models_per_admin: 200\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下cumulative power从单次0.42(δ=1.0)升至3次累积0.71，恰好达到target ~0.70。\n      这符合Bayesian累积的理论预期——每次administration提供independent evidence，\n      posterior precision按√n速率增长。对δ=1.4(paper的operational region)，3次累积达0.85\n      已经很强。prior shrinkage对small N场景尤其有价值——减少40% false positives。\n      best档下此结果作为supplementary analysis(audit protocol的temporal monitoring组件)，\n      不进入main body。与paper framing一致：plan_007标记为P2 simulation-only, underdeveloped。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cumulative Bayesian DIF Power by Administration Count\"\n        columns: [n_administrations, power_delta_10, power_delta_14, power_delta_16, fpr]\n        rows:\n          - [1, 0.42, 0.68, 0.72, 0.041]\n          - [2, 0.58, 0.79, 0.84, 0.038]\n          - [3, 0.71, 0.85, 0.90, 0.035]\n          - [4, 0.78, 0.89, 0.93, 0.033]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Power accumulation curve across administrations for δ∈{0.8, 1.0, 1.4, 1.6}\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cumulative Bayesian framework为audit protocol的longitudinal monitoring提供理论基础：\n      即使单次检测power有限(0.42 at δ=1.0)，3-4次累积后power接近0.80。\n      这直接支撑三tier audit protocol中的\"monitor\"层(C%<15)——低于action阈值的items\n      可通过cumulative monitoring最终达到decision threshold。Appendix material。\n\n  - name: graceful_degradation_analysis\n    plan_id: plan_008\n    description: >\n      Progressive item replacement下的benchmark validity degradation分析：\n      ranking stability、score reliability、construct coverage随replacement率的变化。\n    expected_results:\n      replacement_5pct:\n        ranking_rho: 0.999\n        reliability_alpha: 0.968\n        construct_coverage: 0.98\n      replacement_10pct:\n        ranking_rho: 0.997\n        reliability_alpha: 0.961\n        construct_coverage: 0.96\n      replacement_20pct:\n        ranking_rho: 0.993\n        reliability_alpha: 0.948\n        construct_coverage: 0.93\n      replacement_50pct:\n        ranking_rho: 0.978\n        reliability_alpha: 0.912\n        construct_coverage: 0.85\n      theoretical_bound_ranking: \"ρ ≥ 1 - 0.45r where r is replacement fraction\"\n      theoretical_bound_reliability: \"α ≥ α₀(1 - 0.8r²)\"\n      empirical_validation_rho_vs_bound: 0.994\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下graceful degradation非常温和——50%替换后ranking ρ仍然0.978。\n      这与plan_017/plan_032的发现一致：MMLU具有massive measurement redundancy (ρ≈0.997\n      在31% DIF item removal后)，说明12,508 items中存在大量redundant measurement。\n      reliability从0.97降至0.91(50%替换)反映alpha对item数量的敏感性，但仍在可接受范围。\n      construct coverage下降(0.85 at 50%)是最敏感的指标——某些subject的coverage在高替换率下\n      因item数量不足而退化。theoretical bound与empirical fit的高相关(0.994)说明degradation\n      是predictable和manageable的。best档下此结果支撑audit protocol的\"act\"层decision-making。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Benchmark Validity Metrics Under Progressive Replacement\"\n        columns: [replacement_pct, ranking_rho, reliability_alpha, construct_coverage]\n        rows:\n          - [0, 1.000, 0.972, 1.00]\n          - [5, 0.999, 0.968, 0.98]\n          - [10, 0.997, 0.961, 0.96]\n          - [20, 0.993, 0.948, 0.93]\n          - [31, 0.990, 0.935, 0.89]\n          - [50, 0.978, 0.912, 0.85]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Three validity metrics vs replacement fraction, with theoretical bounds overlaid\"\n    analysis: >\n      Graceful degradation结果直接支撑\"instability ≠ invalidity\"核心叙事：\n      即使替换31% DIF items，所有validity metrics仍在可接受范围内。\n      这与plan_017的ρ=0.996-0.999完全一致。对paper的audit protocol提供quantitative backing：\n      benchmark maintainers可以confidently替换C-flagged items而不担心validity collapse。\n\n  - name: item_focused_trees\n    plan_id: plan_009\n    description: >\n      Item-Focused Trees (Tutz & Berger, 2016) 实现：以model release date为continuous covariate\n      替代categorical cohort split的DIF检测，与MH categorical DIF的对比。\n    expected_results:\n      n_items_analyzed: 12508\n      ift_dif_detection_rate: 0.34\n      ift_mh_concordance: 0.88\n      ift_unique_detections: 412\n      mh_unique_detections: 287\n      ift_continuous_advantage: \"detects gradual drift missed by binary split\"\n      ift_vs_mh_jaccard: 0.81\n      ift_nonlinear_items: 856\n      ift_split_point_mode: \"2023-Q4\"\n      computation_time_hours: 8\n      cross_validation_stability: 0.91\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下IFT detection rate 34%略高于MH的31.3%，因为continuous treatment of release date\n      捕获了binary split遗漏的gradual drift items——某些items的difficulty在2023-Q3开始\n      渐变而非在2023/2024 boundary突变。concordance 0.88和Jaccard 0.81说明两种方法\n      大量overlap但各有unique detections。IFT的split point mode在2023-Q4与temporal cohort\n      boundary一致，验证了categorical split的reasonable choice。\n      856个nonlinear items(difficulty随时间非单调变化)是IFT独有的insight——\n      binary DIF无法捕获\"先变难后变容易\"的pattern。\n      best档下此结果作为robustness check强化Claim 1：continuous method也给出~30%+ instability。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: IFT vs MH-DIF Detection Comparison\"\n        columns: [method, detection_rate, unique_items, computation_hours]\n        rows:\n          - [MH-DIF (categorical), 31.3%, 287, 0.5]\n          - [IFT (continuous), 34.0%, 412, 8.0]\n          - [Overlap (both), \"—\", \"Jaccard=0.81\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: IFT split point distribution across items — histogram of optimal temporal cut points\"\n      - \"Fig: Example items showing gradual vs abrupt DIF, with IFT tree structure\"\n    analysis: >\n      IFT as robustness check完美服务best档叙事：不同方法学(continuous vs categorical)\n      converge on same ~30%+ instability finding。IFT的8h computation vs MH的0.5h说明\n      MH作为primary method的practical advantage。nonlinear items是interesting supplementary finding\n      但不改变main conclusion。Paper placement: appendix robustness check。\n\n  - name: architecture_stratified_dif\n    plan_id: plan_010\n    description: >\n      Architecture-homogeneous subpopulation内的DIF分析：decoder-only only subset、\n      IRT fit diagnostics、homogeneous vs full population DIF比较。\n    expected_results:\n      n_decoder_only: 5226\n      n_non_decoder: 1\n      pct_decoder_only: 99.98\n      full_population_c_pct: 31.3\n      decoder_only_c_pct: 31.3\n      jaccard_full_vs_decoder_only: 1.0\n      rmsea_full: 0.031\n      rmsea_decoder_only: 0.031\n      cfi_full: 0.89\n      cfi_decoder_only: 0.89\n      irt_fit_change: \"negligible — removing 1 model changes nothing\"\n      architecture_heterogeneity_verdict: \"non-issue for METABENCH MMLU\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下architecture stratification结果trivial——METABENCH MMLU中99.98%(5226/5227)\n      是decoder-only，唯一的non-decoder模型移除后Jaccard=1.0，C%完全不变。\n      这是paper_framing中已记录的结果。IRT fit indices不变因为单个模型的移除对5227×12508\n      矩阵的统计量影响在numerical noise范围内。\n      best档下此结果是proactive defense against \"architecture heterogeneity inflates DIF\"\n      reviewer concern的一行报告：METABENCH MMLU is architecturally homogeneous, concern is moot。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Architecture Stratification Impact\"\n        columns: [population, n_models, c_pct, jaccard_vs_full, rmsea]\n        rows:\n          - [Full population, 5227, 31.3, \"—\", 0.031]\n          - [Decoder-only only, 5226, 31.3, 1.0, 0.031]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: (不需要——结果trivial，一句话报告即可)\"\n    analysis: >\n      此实验在best档下是一行proactive defense。reviewer concern about architecture heterogeneity\n      在METABENCH MMLU上empirically无意义。paper中作为脚注或inline报告而非独立subsection。\n\n  - name: semi_synthetic_contamination_validation\n    plan_id: plan_011\n    description: >\n      Real METABENCH response matrix上的known contamination injection：500 clean items选择、\n      100-200 items注入synthetic contamination(incorrect→correct flipping)、\n      controlled ground truth下的TPR/FPR测量、injection参数变化(prevalence, exploitation rate, focal group size)。\n    expected_results:\n      temporal_external_tpr_p0: 0.326\n      temporal_external_tpr_p03: 0.548\n      temporal_external_tpr_p05: 0.834\n      temporal_external_tpr_p07: 0.990\n      temporal_external_tpr_p10: 1.000\n      temporal_external_fpr: 0.314\n      temporal_external_delta_tpr_p05: 0.508\n      temporal_external_delta_tpr_p10: 0.674\n      ability_external_tpr_p10: 0.800\n      ability_external_fpr: 0.493\n      standard_mh_fpr_inflation: \"0.298→0.616 at p=1.0\"\n      cross_subject_matching_fpr_stable: true\n      dose_response_monotonic: true\n      injection_n_items: 200\n      clean_baseline_n_items: 500\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下semi-synthetic validation的核心是ΔTPR=+0.508 at p=0.5——这证明DIF能检测\n      known differential contamination(注入的ground truth)。dose-response单调性(从p=0.3到p=1.0\n      TPR单调上升)确认检测力与exploitation rate成正比，排除了random artifact。\n      baseline FPR=0.314反映temporal cohort的genuine item-level DIF(与plan_001的31.3%一致)，\n      而非false positives——这些\"false\" positives实际上是真实的temporal instability。\n      cross-subject matching的FPR stability(vs standard matching的inflation至0.616)\n      是Claim 3的关键贡献：matching variable contamination是subtle but critical methodological issue。\n      best档下这些数字完美支撑三贡献结构中的Claim 2(semi-synthetic proves DIF detects\n      what web-overlap labels cannot capture)和Claim 3(cross-subject matching as reusable infrastructure)。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Semi-Synthetic Detection Power (Cross-Subject Matching)\"\n        columns: [exploitation_rate_p, tpr, delta_tpr, fpr, fpr_inflation]\n        rows:\n          - [0.0 (baseline), 0.326, \"—\", 0.314, 0.000]\n          - [0.3, 0.548, +0.222, 0.314, 0.000]\n          - [0.5, 0.834, +0.508, 0.314, 0.000]\n          - [0.7, 0.990, +0.664, 0.314, 0.000]\n          - [1.0, 1.000, +0.674, 0.314, 0.000]\n      - name: \"Table: Matching Strategy Comparison at p=1.0\"\n        columns: [matching, tpr, fpr, delta_fpr_vs_baseline]\n        rows:\n          - [Standard (within-benchmark), 1.000, 0.616, +0.298]\n          - [Cross-subject (external), 1.000, 0.314, 0.000]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Dose-response curve — ΔTPR vs exploitation rate p, with 95% CI bands\"\n      - \"Fig: FPR comparison — standard vs cross-subject matching across injection levels\"\n    analysis: >\n      semi-synthetic validation是paper中load-bearing experiment之一。ΔTPR=+0.508是Claim 2\n      的empirical anchor：如果DIF只检测\"noise\"，注入known contamination不应提升TPR。\n      cross-subject matching的ΔFPR=0.000(5个subjects全部)是Claim 3的practical innovation proof。\n      best档下此实验与plan_016(within-subject semi-synthetic)共同构成semi-synthetic framework\n      的完整validation story。\n\n  - name: multi_benchmark_temporal_dif\n    plan_id: plan_028\n    description: >\n      METABENCH中额外benchmark(ARC-Challenge, HellaSwag, WinoGrande, TruthfulQA)的\n      temporal DIF分析，加上已完成的MMLU和GSM8K，共6个benchmark。\n    expected_results:\n      mmlu:\n        n_items: 12508\n        n_ref: 1080\n        n_foc: 807\n        pct_c: 31.3\n        random_pct_c: 0.18\n        bootstrap_ci_95: [29.38, 38.05]\n      winogrande:\n        n_items: 1267\n        n_ref: 1017\n        n_foc: 803\n        pct_c: 30.3\n        random_pct_c: 0.32\n      truthfulqa:\n        n_items: 817\n        n_ref: 1080\n        n_foc: 807\n        pct_c: 29.7\n        random_pct_c: 0.37\n      arc:\n        n_items: 1172\n        n_ref: 1080\n        n_foc: 807\n        pct_c: 26.9\n        random_pct_c: 0.60\n      gsm8k:\n        n_items: 1319\n        n_ref: 1017\n        n_foc: 804\n        pct_c: 18.9\n        random_pct_c: 0.30\n      hellaswag:\n        n_items: 10042\n        n_ref: 1080\n        n_foc: 807\n        pct_c: 17.9\n        random_pct_c: 0.28\n      cross_benchmark_range: \"17.9–31.3%\"\n      all_random_controls_below_1pct: true\n      min_enrichment_ratio_vs_random: 45\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下6 benchmark全部显示显著temporal DIF(17.9-31.3%)，所有random controls <1%。\n      C%的跨benchmark range反映benchmark结构差异：MMLU/WinoGrande/TruthfulQA(多domain/多题型)\n      的C%较高(29-31%)因为item heterogeneity提供更多DIF机会；\n      GSM8K/HellaSwag(单domain或特定task)较低(17-19%)因为items更同质，\n      differential functioning更多被ability matching吸收。\n      ARC(26.9%)居中。enrichment ratio(vs random)最低45×说明temporal DIF在所有benchmark\n      上都far above chance。best档下6-benchmark consistency是Claim 1 generalizability的核心证据，\n      直接回应\"only validated on MMLU\"的reviewer concern。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-Benchmark Temporal DIF Summary\"\n        columns: [benchmark, n_items, n_ref, n_foc, pct_c, random_pct_c, ratio]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU, 12508, 1080, 807, 31.3, 0.18, 174×]\n          - [WinoGrande, 1267, 1017, 803, 30.3, 0.32, 95×]\n          - [TruthfulQA, 817, 1080, 807, 29.7, 0.37, 80×]\n          - [ARC-Challenge, 1172, 1080, 807, 26.9, 0.60, 45×]\n          - [GSM8K, 1319, 1017, 804, 18.9, 0.30, 63×]\n          - [HellaSwag, 10042, 1080, 807, 17.9, 0.28, 64×]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Bar chart of C% across 6 benchmarks, with random control overlay and 95% bootstrap CIs\"\n    analysis: >\n      6-benchmark consistency(全部>15%、全部random<1%)是best档的strongest generalizability evidence。\n      range 17.9-31.3%在best档key metrics范围内(cross_benchmark_c_pct_min 17-20%, max 29-33%)。\n      此结果被审稿人视为充分跨benchmark证据，不需要additional benchmarks。\n\n  - name: permutation_null_c_rate\n    plan_id: plan_029\n    description: >\n      1000× permutation test：随机重分配2023/2024 temporal labels(保持group sizes N_ref=1080,\n      N_foc=807)，每次运行MH-DIF，建立C%的null distribution。\n    expected_results:\n      n_permutations: 1000\n      null_c_pct_mean: 0.21\n      null_c_pct_sd: 0.05\n      null_c_pct_max: 0.42\n      null_c_pct_p95: 0.30\n      null_c_pct_p99: 0.36\n      observed_c_pct: 31.3\n      permutation_p_value: \"<0.001\"\n      z_score_observed_vs_null: \">600\"\n      null_distribution_shape: \"approximately normal, centered near random-split control\"\n      consistency_with_random_split: true\n      random_split_c_pct: 0.18\n      computation_time_hours: 12\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下permutation null的mean C%=0.21%与within-cohort random split(0.18%)高度一致——\n      这是预期的，因为random label permutation破坏temporal信号后，MH-DIF只能检测到\n      random fluctuation，与random split在概率上等价。null C% max=0.42%说明1000次permutation\n      中最极端的case也远低于observed 31.3%。z>600意味着observed值在null distribution的\n      >600个标准差之外，permutation p<0.001(实际上是p<1/1000因为0/1000 permutations达到31.3%)。\n      best档下此结果直接回答\"is 31% above chance?\"——答案是overwhelming yes。\n      null distribution的near-normal shape和consistency with random split互相验证了两种\n      null estimation方法的正确性。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Permutation Null Distribution Summary\"\n        columns: [statistic, value]\n        rows:\n          - [Observed C%, 31.3]\n          - [Null mean C%, 0.21]\n          - [Null SD, 0.05]\n          - [Null max (1000 perms), 0.42]\n          - [Permutation p-value, \"<0.001\"]\n          - [z-score, \">600\"]\n          - [Random-split control C%, 0.18]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Null distribution histogram (1000 permutations) with observed 31.3% marked as vertical red line, far off-scale\"\n    analysis: >\n      Permutation null是Claim 1最直接的statistical significance evidence。\n      null mean 0.21%与random split 0.18%的一致性(差异0.03pp)说明两种null estimation converge。\n      observed 31.3%在null的>600σ之外——这不是marginal significance，而是absolute certainty\n      that temporal DIF is real。best档下审稿人无法质疑\"31% is chance level\"。\n      此实验落在best档key metrics范围内(permutation_null_c_pct [0.0, 1.0])。\n\n  - name: odds_ratio_regression_transparency\n    plan_id: plan_030\n    description: >\n      DIF flag的logistic regression透明度分析：odds ratio + 95% CI + 多种R²指标 + deviance ratio。\n      item-level finer-grained model (DIF flag ~ item-level accuracy change)补充domain-level分析。\n    expected_results:\n      model1_domain_delta:\n        mcfadden_r2: 0.0007\n        nagelkerke_r2: 0.0012\n        subject_acc_delta_or_per_010: 1.55\n        subject_acc_delta_ci_per_010: [1.19, 2.03]\n      model2_domain_delta_plus_items:\n        mcfadden_r2: 0.0423\n        nagelkerke_r2: 0.072\n        subject_acc_delta_or_per_010: 0.73\n        ctt_discrimination_or_per_010: 1.51\n      model3_item_delta:\n        mcfadden_r2: 0.0012\n        nagelkerke_r2: 0.0021\n        item_acc_change_or_per_010: 1.08\n        item_acc_change_ci: [1.51, 2.96]\n      model4_item_delta_plus_items:\n        mcfadden_r2: 0.0434\n        nagelkerke_r2: 0.0737\n        item_acc_change_or_per_010: 0.92\n        ctt_discrimination_or_per_010: 1.54\n      simpsons_paradox: true\n      lr_test_m1_vs_m2_chi2: 646.98\n      lr_test_m3_vs_m4_chi2: 655.53\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下四个模型的R²全部极低(<0.08)，这是core finding而非limitation：\n      accuracy change(无论domain-level还是item-level)解释DIF variance的能力极弱，\n      说明DIF捕获的是item-specific differential functioning而非aggregate accuracy improvement。\n      Simpson's paradox(Model 1中OR=1.55 per 0.10 accuracy change但Model 2/4中OR翻转至<1)\n      说明item properties(difficulty, discrimination)是confounders——controlling后accuracy change\n      的apparent effect消失甚至反转。best档下此结果是plan_019(decomposition: ≤2.4pp/7.6%)\n      的complementary evidence，用不同方法学(logistic regression vs item-level decomposition)\n      converge on same conclusion。discrimination OR=1.54最具信息量：high-discrimination items\n      更容易被flag为DIF-C，因为它们对ability差异更敏感，微小的cohort composition差异就能触发large |Δ_MH|。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Logistic Regression Models for DIF Flag Prediction\"\n        columns: [model, predictors, mcfadden_r2, nagelkerke_r2, key_or]\n        rows:\n          - [Model 1, subject_acc_Δ, 0.0007, 0.0012, \"1.55 [1.19,2.03]\"]\n          - [Model 2, subject_acc_Δ + item_props, 0.0423, 0.072, \"0.73 (reversed)\"]\n          - [Model 3, item_acc_Δ, 0.0012, 0.0021, \"1.08 [1.51,2.96]\"]\n          - [Model 4, item_acc_Δ + item_props, 0.0434, 0.0737, \"0.92 (reversed)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Simpson's paradox visualization — marginal vs conditional OR for accuracy change\"\n    analysis: >\n      Simpson's paradox是this experiment的signature finding。Model 1作为primary(conservative,\n      gives accuracy change its best shot at explaining DIF)，Model 2作为supplementary\n      (shows the paradox)。审稿人看到R²<0.001 for accuracy change alone即可确信\n      \"31% is not just models getting better\"。dual interpretation explicitly acknowledged in Discussion。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":23898,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":23898},"output_tokens":25,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6478f727-08b4-4009-a806-296c75160ef1","uuid":"517858e8-72d7-402b-b2e7-adee75b3a758"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":335903,"duration_api_ms":337554,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始framing完全成立。三贡献清晰：(1) 首次大规模temporal measurement drift实证发现，6个benchmark一致性证实泛化性；\n  (2) ground truth meta-critique改变领域对web-overlap验证的认知；(3) semi-synthetic + cross-subject matching作为可复用基础设施。\n  '31% instability robust to all controls'作为headline。DIF as diagnostic lens + audit protocol提供actionable价值。无需调整claims强度。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: real_data_dif_mmlu\n    plan_id: plan_001\n    description: >\n      METABENCH MMLU response matrix (5,219 models × 12,508 items) 上的全量DIF分析。\n      temporal cohort (2023 vs 2024-H1)、ability-quintile split、within-family confound control、domain-specificity分析。\n    expected_results:\n      temporal_ets_c_pct: 31.3\n      temporal_fpr_li_clean: 0.318\n      temporal_enrichment: 0.96\n      ability_ets_c_pct: 2.9\n      ability_enrichment: 1.19\n      within_family_llama2v3_c_pct: 61.3\n      within_family_mistral_mixtral_c_pct: 38.7\n      domain_spearman_rho: 0.307\n      domain_spearman_p: 0.02\n      sanity_random_split_c_pct: 0.18\n      temporal_ability_jaccard: 0.014\n      n_models_temporal_ref: 1080\n      n_models_temporal_foc: 807\n      n_items: 12508\n      domain_specificity_c_range: \"20.7–48.4%\"\n      domain_specificity_mean: 30.6\n      negative_disc_items_pct: 15.4\n      negative_disc_sensitivity: \"C% changes <0.5pp with/without negative-disc items\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下temporal cohort的31.3% C%是核心headline数字，已被多层robustness control确认。\n      random split 0.18%证明非统计伪影。enrichment≈0.96与Li et al.标签的理论预期一致——\n      web-overlap是global exposure指标，DIF检测differential functioning，二者正交，enrichment≈1.0是预期结果。\n      ability split仅2.9%说明DIF确实捕获temporal信号而非能力差异。within-family Llama-2v3的61.3%\n      反映两代间巨大能力跳跃(d=-0.99)中的genuine item-level变化，而非伪影。domain相关ρ=0.307\n      表明domain improvement有modest贡献但非主因——plan_019/plan_030进一步量化为≤7.6%。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 1: Temporal DIF Summary (ETS C Classification)\"\n        columns: [cohort_definition, n_ref, n_foc, n_items, pct_A, pct_B, pct_C, enrichment_li, random_sanity_c_pct]\n        rows:\n          - [temporal_2023v2024, 1080, 807, 12508, 52.4, 16.3, 31.3, 0.96, 0.18]\n          - [ability_quintile, 1044, 1044, 12508, 85.2, 11.9, 2.9, 1.19, 0.15]\n          - [within_family_llama, 161, 308, 12508, 24.1, 14.6, 61.3, 0.91, 0.22]\n      - name: \"Table 2: Domain-Specificity Top/Bottom 5 Subjects by C%\"\n        columns: [subject, n_items, pct_c, pct_favor_2024]\n        rows:\n          - [business_ethics, 100, 48.4, 39.6]\n          - [human_aging, 223, 41.9, 38.7]\n          - [formal_logic, 126, 40.4, 42.1]\n          - [management, 103, 21.7, 44.2]\n          - [computer_security, 100, 20.7, 47.3]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 1: Heatmap of 57 MMLU subjects × C% (rows) vs temporal direction (columns), 按domain着色\"\n      - \"Fig 2: DIF flags overlap Venn diagram — temporal vs ability vs within-family，Jaccard=0.014\"\n    analysis: >\n      31.3%作为primary estimate稳固。ability split的2.9%与temporal的31.3%形成鲜明对比，\n      直接排除\"models got better → inflated DIF\"的解释。within-family结果(61.3%)\n      虽然高，但因Llama-2v3能力差距极大(d=-0.99)，plan_027的matching分析已将genuine item-level DIF\n      锁定在~28-29%。domain分析的ρ=0.307(p=0.02)是honest reporting——plan_019的item-level\n      decomposition将其降至≤2.4pp(7.6%)，是paper的关键robustness支撑。\n\n  - name: rl_robustness_validation\n    plan_id: plan_002\n    description: >\n      验证DIF对reasoning-RL模型的鲁棒性。三组对比：SFT-only baseline、alignment-RL(DPO/ORPO, N=477)、\n      reasoning-RL(10-15个GRPO/PPO模型注入focal cohort)。DIF group-level稳定性 vs 传统detector model-level退化。\n    expected_results:\n      n_reasoning_rl_models: 13\n      reasoning_rl_models_list: \"DeepSeek-R1-7B, DeepSeek-R1-32B, Qwen2.5-RL-7B, Qwen2.5-RL-14B, Qwen2.5-RL-32B, Marco-o1-7B, Skywork-OR1-8B, OpenThinker-7B, OpenThinker-32B, s1-32B, STILL-2-7B, Light-R1-7B, Bespoke-Stratos-7B\"\n      sft_baseline_c_pct: 31.3\n      alignment_rl_cohort_c_pct: 31.1\n      reasoning_rl_mixed_cohort_c_pct: 30.8\n      jaccard_sft_vs_alignment_rl: 0.94\n      jaccard_sft_vs_reasoning_rl_mixed: 0.92\n      jaccard_alignment_vs_reasoning_rl: 0.93\n      dif_flag_retention_rate: 0.95\n      bootstrap_ci_jaccard_sft_vs_rl: [0.90, 0.96]\n      tost_equivalence_p: 0.003\n      tost_equivalence_margin: 0.05\n      traditional_mink_auroc_sft: 0.72\n      traditional_mink_auroc_rl: 0.48\n      traditional_constat_auroc_sft: 0.68\n      traditional_constat_auroc_rl: 0.51\n      auroc_drop_mink: 0.24\n      auroc_drop_constat: 0.17\n      delong_mink_p: 0.001\n      delong_constat_p: 0.008\n      partial_exploitation_power:\n        p_04: {dif_tpr: 0.42, mink_auroc: 0.39}\n        p_06: {dif_tpr: 0.61, mink_auroc: 0.44}\n        p_08: {dif_tpr: 0.78, mink_auroc: 0.46}\n        p_10: {dif_tpr: 0.91, mink_auroc: 0.48}\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下Jaccard≥0.90是关键指标。DIF是group-level方法，将13个RL模型加入807个focal cohort\n      (占比1.6%)对MH统计量的影响微乎其微——MH条件化total score后，RL模型的memorization pattern\n      被ability matching吸收。C%从31.3%微降至30.8%是噪声范围内的正常波动。\n      传统detector的AUROC下降0.17-0.24反映Wang et al.论证的NLL gap contraction机制：\n      GRPO/PPO训练使模型对所有选项的logit分布更平坦，破坏了Min-K%和ConStat依赖的\n      per-token surprise信号，但不影响DIF的item-level binary response pattern。\n      TOST equivalence test (margin=0.05, p=0.003)正式确认DIF retention非空结果。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: DIF Stability Across Training Paradigms\"\n        columns: [cohort_composition, n_foc, c_pct, jaccard_vs_sft, bootstrap_ci_95]\n        rows:\n          - [SFT-only (baseline), 807, 31.3, \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [Alignment-RL (DPO/ORPO), 477, 31.1, 0.94, \"[0.92, 0.96]\"]\n          - [SFT+Reasoning-RL mixed, 820, 30.8, 0.92, \"[0.90, 0.96]\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Traditional Detector Degradation on Reasoning-RL\"\n        columns: [detector, auroc_sft, auroc_rl, delta_auroc, delong_p]\n        rows:\n          - [Min-K%, 0.72, 0.48, -0.24, 0.001]\n          - [ConStat, 0.68, 0.51, -0.17, 0.008]\n          - [DIF (group), \"—\", \"—\", \"Jaccard=0.92\", \"TOST p=0.003\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Partial exploitation power curve — DIF TPR vs Min-K% AUROC as function of exploitation rate p∈[0.4, 1.0]\"\n      - \"Fig: Jaccard stability bootstrap distribution (1000 resamples), vertical line at 0.90 threshold\"\n    analysis: >\n      best档核心结论：DIF的group-level design天然免疫于RL训练对individual model信号的扰动。\n      13个RL模型虽少但足够——DIF不需要N≥80个RL模型，只需focal cohort total N≥80且RL模型\n      混入后不改变group-level pattern。Jaccard=0.92超过0.90阈值，TOST正式排除degradation。\n      传统detector的0.17-0.24 AUROC drop提供鲜明对比，强化DIF的methodological advantage叙事。\n      Caveat: N=13 reasoning-RL仍然underpowered for standalone claim，但作为robustness check足够。\n\n  - name: constat_perturbation_eval\n    plan_id: plan_003a\n    description: >\n      ConStat-style perturbation testing独立评估：200+ MMLU items的LLM paraphrase生成、\n      原始vs重述性能对比、FDR-controlled detection、RL vs non-RL检测力对比。\n    expected_results:\n      n_items_paraphrased: 250\n      n_models_tested: 50\n      constat_detection_rate_non_rl: 0.38\n      constat_detection_rate_alignment_rl: 0.31\n      constat_detection_rate_reasoning_rl: 0.14\n      fdr_threshold: 0.05\n      constat_fpr: 0.048\n      constat_tpr_delta_ge_06: 0.62\n      constat_tpr_delta_ge_10: 0.41\n      paraphrase_quality_semantic_sim: 0.91\n      paraphrase_quality_difficulty_corr: 0.83\n      rl_sensitivity_ratio: 0.37\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下ConStat在non-RL模型上表现中等(detection rate 38%)，因为perturbation testing\n      依赖模型对original vs paraphrased的response差异——contaminated模型在original上表现异常好。\n      但reasoning-RL模型通过GRPO训练泛化了problem-solving能力(非verbatim memorization)，\n      使original vs paraphrased差异消失，detection rate降至14%。这为ensemble论证(DIF covers\n      where ConStat fails)提供直接证据。FPR在0.05 FDR控制下保持在0.048。\n      注意：此实验在paper framing中已标记为\"never executed, future work\"，best档下执行它\n      是为了提供完整的baseline comparison数据。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: ConStat Detection Power by Training Paradigm\"\n        columns: [paradigm, n_models, detection_rate, fpr, effect_size_threshold]\n        rows:\n          - [SFT-only, 25, 0.38, 0.048, \"δ≥0.6\"]\n          - [Alignment-RL, 15, 0.31, 0.045, \"δ≥0.6\"]\n          - [Reasoning-RL, 10, 0.14, 0.051, \"δ≥0.6\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Detection rate vs effect size threshold for ConStat across training paradigms\"\n    analysis: >\n      ConStat的RL-sensitivity确认了DIF的structural advantage：DIF条件化ability后检测\n      item-level differential functioning，不依赖per-model perturbation response差异。\n      ConStat适合non-RL场景，DIF适合所有场景。此结果支撑\"DIF as primary, ConStat as complementary\"叙事。\n      但因paper已决定不执行此实验(scope control)，此数据仅作appendix/future work参考。\n\n  - name: dvd_generation_variance_eval\n    plan_id: plan_003b\n    description: >\n      DVD generation variance独立评估：10-15个开源模型、每item 50次temperature sampling、\n      generation variance score计算、bimodal分布检测。\n    expected_results:\n      n_models: 12\n      n_items_sampled: 500\n      temperature: 0.8\n      n_generations_per_item: 50\n      dvd_detection_rate_verbatim: 0.22\n      dvd_detection_rate_variant: 0.45\n      dvd_fpr: 0.065\n      bimodal_detection_rate: 0.33\n      dvd_auroc_verbatim: 0.61\n      dvd_auroc_variant: 0.74\n      compute_hours: 68\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下DVD对variant contamination (非verbatim、通过paraphrase传播的)检测力最强(AUROC=0.74)，\n      因为variant contamination导致模型在某些generation中复现memorized pattern、其他时候正常推理，\n      产生bimodal variance signature。对verbatim contamination反而较弱(AUROC=0.61)，\n      因为verbatim memorization导致consistently correct response，variance反而低。\n      这与DIF(检测任何形式的differential functioning)和ConStat(检测perturbation sensitivity)\n      形成互补覆盖。FPR 0.065略高于理想值但可接受。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: DVD Detection Power by Contamination Type\"\n        columns: [contamination_type, auroc, detection_rate, fpr]\n        rows:\n          - [verbatim, 0.61, 0.22, 0.065]\n          - [variant, 0.74, 0.45, 0.065]\n          - [none (clean), \"—\", \"—\", 0.065]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Generation variance distribution — clean vs verbatim vs variant contaminated items\"\n    analysis: >\n      DVD填补DIF和ConStat的variant contamination检测空白。但GPU cost (68h)和detection rate\n      均不及DIF的zero-GPU设计。此实验与plan_003a一样在paper scope外(never executed)，\n      best档下执行是为ensemble fusion提供完整输入。\n\n  - name: ensemble_fusion\n    plan_id: plan_003c\n    description: >\n      DIF + ConStat + DVD三信号融合：threshold校准、2-of-3 majority voting、weighted fusion、\n      ensemble覆盖分析、5-fold交叉验证。\n    expected_results:\n      ensemble_fpr_majority: 0.032\n      ensemble_fpr_weighted: 0.028\n      ensemble_tpr_majority_delta_14: 0.78\n      ensemble_tpr_weighted_delta_14: 0.82\n      coverage_dif_only: \"δ≥1.4, all training types\"\n      coverage_constat_only: \"δ≥0.6, non-RL only\"\n      coverage_dvd_only: \"variant contamination\"\n      coverage_ensemble: \"δ≥0.6, all types including variant\"\n      cv_weight_dif: 0.52\n      cv_weight_constat: 0.28\n      cv_weight_dvd: 0.20\n      uniform_vs_optimized_auc_gap: 0.03\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下ensemble的FPR<0.05(远低于0.10阈值)因为2-of-3 majority voting天然抑制\n      single-signal false positives。TPR=0.82(weighted)超过任何单一信号因为三个detector\n      覆盖不同contamination机制。DIF权重最高(0.52)反映其跨training-paradigm的一致性。\n      uniform vs optimized差距仅0.03 AUC说明fusion对权重不敏感。\n      但此实验依赖plan_003a/b，且paper已明确dropped ensemble contribution。\n      best档下这是最佳情况的appendix material。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Ensemble vs Individual Detector Performance\"\n        columns: [method, tpr_at_fpr_05, auroc, coverage_type]\n        rows:\n          - [DIF (MH), 0.68, 0.87, \"group-level, all paradigms\"]\n          - [ConStat, 0.55, 0.76, \"model-level, non-RL\"]\n          - [DVD, 0.42, 0.71, \"model-level, variant\"]\n          - [Ensemble (majority), 0.78, 0.91, \"all\"]\n          - [Ensemble (weighted), 0.82, 0.93, \"all\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: ROC curves — DIF, ConStat, DVD, Ensemble (majority), Ensemble (weighted)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Ensemble在best档下表现优异但对paper叙事非必要——DIF standalone已足够支撑三贡献结构。\n      此结果作为future work方向：若DIF + ConStat + DVD三线融合被证实，可升级为独立contribution。\n      当前paper wisely将此降为appendix/dropped。\n\n  - name: cross_benchmark_gsm8k\n    plan_id: plan_004\n    description: >\n      GSM8K上的DIF复制分析：temporal cohort DIF、semi-synthetic validation、GSM1K correlation。\n    expected_results:\n      step1_gsm8k_temporal_c_pct: 18.9\n      step1_n_items: 1319\n      step1_n_ref: 1017\n      step1_n_foc: 804\n      step1_sanity_c_pct: 0.3\n      step1_standard_external_spearman: 0.926\n      step2_standard_delta_tpr_p10: 0.818\n      step2_external_delta_tpr_p10: 0.517\n      step3_n_models: 33\n      step3_pearson_r: -0.478\n      step3_pearson_p: 0.005\n      step3_spearman_rho: -0.403\n      step3_partial_r: -0.385\n      step3_direction: \"NEGATIVE (opposite to contamination hypothesis)\"\n      step3_robust_leave_one_out: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下GSM8K C%=18.9%低于MMLU的31.3%，因为GSM8K是单domain数学benchmark，\n      items间能力维度同质性更高，DIF更多反映genuine capability gain而非item-specific instability。\n      semi-synthetic ΔTPR=+0.818(标准matching)证明framework可移植性——GSM8K的单domain结构\n      使matching variable(total score)与target items共线性更强，但仍能检测injected contamination。\n      GSM1K correlation r=-0.478(negative)是关键finding：DIF flags与contamination gap\n      反向关联，说明DIF在GSM8K上捕获的不是contamination而是capability-driven item functioning变化。\n      这是honest reporting——不利于\"DIF detects contamination\"叙事，但完美支撑\"DIF as diagnostic lens\"\n      reframing。best档下此negative result被视为strength而非weakness。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: GSM8K Three-Step Validation\"\n        columns: [step, metric, value, interpretation]\n        rows:\n          - [Step 1, temporal_c_pct, 18.9%, \"Lower than MMLU, consistent with single-domain\"]\n          - [Step 1, sanity_c_pct, 0.3%, \"Well below temporal signal\"]\n          - [Step 2, delta_tpr_p10, \"+0.818\", \"Framework portable to math benchmark\"]\n          - [Step 3, pearson_r, -0.478, \"DIF ≠ contamination on GSM8K\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: GSM1K gap vs DIF-C count scatter (N=33 models), with Cook's D outlier annotation\"\n    analysis: >\n      GSM8K结果在best档下完美服务于paper的reframed叙事：DIF是diagnostic tool而非contamination detector。\n      r=-0.478的negative correlation被明确demote为exploratory(N=33, CI wide)，不进入abstract/conclusion。\n      semi-synthetic ΔTPR=+0.818是Claim 3(framework)的cross-benchmark replication支撑。\n\n  - name: bifactor_irt_equating_pilot\n    plan_id: plan_005\n    description: >\n      MMLU上的bifactor IRT equating pilot：general factor + 57 subject-specific factors拟合、\n      anchor item选择、fixed-parameter calibration、equated score equivalence验证。\n    expected_results:\n      bifactor_rmsea: 0.028\n      bifactor_cfi: 0.91\n      bifactor_tli: 0.89\n      bifactor_srmr: 0.045\n      general_factor_variance_explained: 0.31\n      n_anchor_items_selected: 850\n      anchor_stability_criterion: \"no DIF across cohorts, discrimination >0.5\"\n      equated_rho: 0.97\n      convergence_time_hours: 48\n      convergence_issues: \"3/57 subject factors had Heywood cases; fixed with constrained estimation\"\n      practical_verdict: \"fit marginal but usable for equating pilot\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下bifactor模型拟合marginal(CFI=0.91, TLI=0.89略低于0.95标准)，\n      但这是预期结果——12,508 items × 57 subjects的bifactor是极高维模型，MMLU的inherent\n      multidimensionality(57 subjects covering distinct knowledge domains)使完美拟合不现实。\n      general factor仅解释31% variance确认MMLU fundamentally multidimensional。\n      equated score的ρ=0.97 > 0.95目标说明即使fit marginal，equating仍然workable。\n      但registry显示plan_015(对应此计划)被killed——在best档下这意味着虽然结果positive，\n      但团队正确判断bifactor不是paper的core contribution，将其kill是scope control决策而非technical failure。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Bifactor IRT Fit Indices\"\n        columns: [index, value, threshold, verdict]\n        rows:\n          - [RMSEA, 0.028, \"<0.06\", PASS]\n          - [CFI, 0.91, \">0.95\", MARGINAL]\n          - [TLI, 0.89, \">0.95\", MARGINAL]\n          - [SRMR, 0.045, \"<0.08\", PASS]\n          - [General factor ω, 0.31, \">0.50\", FAIL]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Scree plot — general factor + 57 subject factors eigenvalue distribution\"\n    analysis: >\n      Bifactor结果确认MMLU的multidimensionality是structural reality而非estimation artifact。\n      general factor ω=0.31说明unidimensional IRT fundamentally misspecified for MMLU——\n      这是Limitations section的直接输入。best档下此结果被correctly scoped为motivation for\n      future multidimensional IRT work，不作为numbered contribution。plan_015被kill是正确决策。\n\n  - name: item_generation_calibration\n    plan_id: plan_006\n    description: >\n      DIF-flagged MMLU items的替换生成：LLM generation with construct constraints、\n      student simulation校准、difficulty correlation评估。\n    expected_results:\n      n_items_generated: 500\n      n_dif_items_targeted: 200\n      prompt_difficulty_rho: 0.32\n      simulation_difficulty_rho: 0.71\n      cognitive_level_match_rate: 0.78\n      subject_match_rate: 1.0\n      holdout_validation_rho: 0.65\n      generation_model: \"claude-3.5-sonnet\"\n      student_simulation_model: \"arXiv 2601.09953 protocol\"\n      calibration_rmse: 0.18\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下prompt-based difficulty targeting的ρ=0.32与文献报告(0.10-0.45)一致——\n      LLM对item difficulty的直觉calibration有限。student simulation将其提升至ρ=0.71，\n      远好于prompt-only但仍低于target benchmark的0.75-0.82。holdout validation ρ=0.65\n      反映generalization gap。cognitive level matching 78%说明同subject同difficulty≠同cognitive demand。\n      best档下此结果支撑\"item generation is feasible but imperfect\"的honest assessment，\n      与paper scope control一致(此实验在framing中标记为below benchmarks, dropped)。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Item Generation Calibration Accuracy\"\n        columns: [method, difficulty_rho, cognitive_match, holdout_rho]\n        rows:\n          - [Prompt-only targeting, 0.32, 0.65, 0.28]\n          - [Student simulation, 0.71, 0.78, 0.65]\n          - [Literature benchmark, \"0.75-0.82\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Generated vs original item difficulty scatter — prompt-only vs simulation-calibrated\"\n    analysis: >\n      此实验确认item generation作为standalone contribution不够成熟，正确dropped from main paper。\n      student simulation的0.71相关性是promising future direction但不足以支撑equating pipeline claim。\n\n  - name: cumulative_bayesian_dif\n    plan_id: plan_007\n    description: >\n      Sinharay et al. (2006) cumulative Bayesian DIF priors实现：4次successive benchmark administrations模拟、\n      累积evidence下的power improvement量化。\n    expected_results:\n      n_simulated_administrations: 4\n      individual_admin_power_delta_10: 0.42\n      cumulative_2admin_power_delta_10: 0.58\n      cumulative_3admin_power_delta_10: 0.71\n      cumulative_4admin_power_delta_10: 0.78\n      individual_admin_power_delta_14: 0.68\n      cumulative_3admin_power_delta_14: 0.85\n      fpr_all_conditions: \"<0.055\"\n      prior_shrinkage_effect: \"reduces false positives at small N by 40%\"\n      bayes_factor_threshold: 10\n      posterior_prob_threshold: 0.95\n      simulation_n_items: 500\n      simulation_n_models_per_admin: 200\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下cumulative power从单次0.42(δ=1.0)升至3次累积0.71，恰好达到target ~0.70。\n      这符合Bayesian累积的理论预期——每次administration提供independent evidence，\n      posterior precision按√n速率增长。对δ=1.4(paper的operational region)，3次累积达0.85\n      已经很强。prior shrinkage对small N场景尤其有价值——减少40% false positives。\n      best档下此结果作为supplementary analysis(audit protocol的temporal monitoring组件)，\n      不进入main body。与paper framing一致：plan_007标记为P2 simulation-only, underdeveloped。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cumulative Bayesian DIF Power by Administration Count\"\n        columns: [n_administrations, power_delta_10, power_delta_14, power_delta_16, fpr]\n        rows:\n          - [1, 0.42, 0.68, 0.72, 0.041]\n          - [2, 0.58, 0.79, 0.84, 0.038]\n          - [3, 0.71, 0.85, 0.90, 0.035]\n          - [4, 0.78, 0.89, 0.93, 0.033]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Power accumulation curve across administrations for δ∈{0.8, 1.0, 1.4, 1.6}\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cumulative Bayesian framework为audit protocol的longitudinal monitoring提供理论基础：\n      即使单次检测power有限(0.42 at δ=1.0)，3-4次累积后power接近0.80。\n      这直接支撑三tier audit protocol中的\"monitor\"层(C%<15)——低于action阈值的items\n      可通过cumulative monitoring最终达到decision threshold。Appendix material。\n\n  - name: graceful_degradation_analysis\n    plan_id: plan_008\n    description: >\n      Progressive item replacement下的benchmark validity degradation分析：\n      ranking stability、score reliability、construct coverage随replacement率的变化。\n    expected_results:\n      replacement_5pct:\n        ranking_rho: 0.999\n        reliability_alpha: 0.968\n        construct_coverage: 0.98\n      replacement_10pct:\n        ranking_rho: 0.997\n        reliability_alpha: 0.961\n        construct_coverage: 0.96\n      replacement_20pct:\n        ranking_rho: 0.993\n        reliability_alpha: 0.948\n        construct_coverage: 0.93\n      replacement_50pct:\n        ranking_rho: 0.978\n        reliability_alpha: 0.912\n        construct_coverage: 0.85\n      theoretical_bound_ranking: \"ρ ≥ 1 - 0.45r where r is replacement fraction\"\n      theoretical_bound_reliability: \"α ≥ α₀(1 - 0.8r²)\"\n      empirical_validation_rho_vs_bound: 0.994\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下graceful degradation非常温和——50%替换后ranking ρ仍然0.978。\n      这与plan_017/plan_032的发现一致：MMLU具有massive measurement redundancy (ρ≈0.997\n      在31% DIF item removal后)，说明12,508 items中存在大量redundant measurement。\n      reliability从0.97降至0.91(50%替换)反映alpha对item数量的敏感性，但仍在可接受范围。\n      construct coverage下降(0.85 at 50%)是最敏感的指标——某些subject的coverage在高替换率下\n      因item数量不足而退化。theoretical bound与empirical fit的高相关(0.994)说明degradation\n      是predictable和manageable的。best档下此结果支撑audit protocol的\"act\"层decision-making。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Benchmark Validity Metrics Under Progressive Replacement\"\n        columns: [replacement_pct, ranking_rho, reliability_alpha, construct_coverage]\n        rows:\n          - [0, 1.000, 0.972, 1.00]\n          - [5, 0.999, 0.968, 0.98]\n          - [10, 0.997, 0.961, 0.96]\n          - [20, 0.993, 0.948, 0.93]\n          - [31, 0.990, 0.935, 0.89]\n          - [50, 0.978, 0.912, 0.85]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Three validity metrics vs replacement fraction, with theoretical bounds overlaid\"\n    analysis: >\n      Graceful degradation结果直接支撑\"instability ≠ invalidity\"核心叙事：\n      即使替换31% DIF items，所有validity metrics仍在可接受范围内。\n      这与plan_017的ρ=0.996-0.999完全一致。对paper的audit protocol提供quantitative backing：\n      benchmark maintainers可以confidently替换C-flagged items而不担心validity collapse。\n\n  - name: item_focused_trees\n    plan_id: plan_009\n    description: >\n      Item-Focused Trees (Tutz & Berger, 2016) 实现：以model release date为continuous covariate\n      替代categorical cohort split的DIF检测，与MH categorical DIF的对比。\n    expected_results:\n      n_items_analyzed: 12508\n      ift_dif_detection_rate: 0.34\n      ift_mh_concordance: 0.88\n      ift_unique_detections: 412\n      mh_unique_detections: 287\n      ift_continuous_advantage: \"detects gradual drift missed by binary split\"\n      ift_vs_mh_jaccard: 0.81\n      ift_nonlinear_items: 856\n      ift_split_point_mode: \"2023-Q4\"\n      computation_time_hours: 8\n      cross_validation_stability: 0.91\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下IFT detection rate 34%略高于MH的31.3%，因为continuous treatment of release date\n      捕获了binary split遗漏的gradual drift items——某些items的difficulty在2023-Q3开始\n      渐变而非在2023/2024 boundary突变。concordance 0.88和Jaccard 0.81说明两种方法\n      大量overlap但各有unique detections。IFT的split point mode在2023-Q4与temporal cohort\n      boundary一致，验证了categorical split的reasonable choice。\n      856个nonlinear items(difficulty随时间非单调变化)是IFT独有的insight——\n      binary DIF无法捕获\"先变难后变容易\"的pattern。\n      best档下此结果作为robustness check强化Claim 1：continuous method也给出~30%+ instability。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: IFT vs MH-DIF Detection Comparison\"\n        columns: [method, detection_rate, unique_items, computation_hours]\n        rows:\n          - [MH-DIF (categorical), 31.3%, 287, 0.5]\n          - [IFT (continuous), 34.0%, 412, 8.0]\n          - [Overlap (both), \"—\", \"Jaccard=0.81\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: IFT split point distribution across items — histogram of optimal temporal cut points\"\n      - \"Fig: Example items showing gradual vs abrupt DIF, with IFT tree structure\"\n    analysis: >\n      IFT as robustness check完美服务best档叙事：不同方法学(continuous vs categorical)\n      converge on same ~30%+ instability finding。IFT的8h computation vs MH的0.5h说明\n      MH作为primary method的practical advantage。nonlinear items是interesting supplementary finding\n      但不改变main conclusion。Paper placement: appendix robustness check。\n\n  - name: architecture_stratified_dif\n    plan_id: plan_010\n    description: >\n      Architecture-homogeneous subpopulation内的DIF分析：decoder-only only subset、\n      IRT fit diagnostics、homogeneous vs full population DIF比较。\n    expected_results:\n      n_decoder_only: 5226\n      n_non_decoder: 1\n      pct_decoder_only: 99.98\n      full_population_c_pct: 31.3\n      decoder_only_c_pct: 31.3\n      jaccard_full_vs_decoder_only: 1.0\n      rmsea_full: 0.031\n      rmsea_decoder_only: 0.031\n      cfi_full: 0.89\n      cfi_decoder_only: 0.89\n      irt_fit_change: \"negligible — removing 1 model changes nothing\"\n      architecture_heterogeneity_verdict: \"non-issue for METABENCH MMLU\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下architecture stratification结果trivial——METABENCH MMLU中99.98%(5226/5227)\n      是decoder-only，唯一的non-decoder模型移除后Jaccard=1.0，C%完全不变。\n      这是paper_framing中已记录的结果。IRT fit indices不变因为单个模型的移除对5227×12508\n      矩阵的统计量影响在numerical noise范围内。\n      best档下此结果是proactive defense against \"architecture heterogeneity inflates DIF\"\n      reviewer concern的一行报告：METABENCH MMLU is architecturally homogeneous, concern is moot。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Architecture Stratification Impact\"\n        columns: [population, n_models, c_pct, jaccard_vs_full, rmsea]\n        rows:\n          - [Full population, 5227, 31.3, \"—\", 0.031]\n          - [Decoder-only only, 5226, 31.3, 1.0, 0.031]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: (不需要——结果trivial，一句话报告即可)\"\n    analysis: >\n      此实验在best档下是一行proactive defense。reviewer concern about architecture heterogeneity\n      在METABENCH MMLU上empirically无意义。paper中作为脚注或inline报告而非独立subsection。\n\n  - name: semi_synthetic_contamination_validation\n    plan_id: plan_011\n    description: >\n      Real METABENCH response matrix上的known contamination injection：500 clean items选择、\n      100-200 items注入synthetic contamination(incorrect→correct flipping)、\n      controlled ground truth下的TPR/FPR测量、injection参数变化(prevalence, exploitation rate, focal group size)。\n    expected_results:\n      temporal_external_tpr_p0: 0.326\n      temporal_external_tpr_p03: 0.548\n      temporal_external_tpr_p05: 0.834\n      temporal_external_tpr_p07: 0.990\n      temporal_external_tpr_p10: 1.000\n      temporal_external_fpr: 0.314\n      temporal_external_delta_tpr_p05: 0.508\n      temporal_external_delta_tpr_p10: 0.674\n      ability_external_tpr_p10: 0.800\n      ability_external_fpr: 0.493\n      standard_mh_fpr_inflation: \"0.298→0.616 at p=1.0\"\n      cross_subject_matching_fpr_stable: true\n      dose_response_monotonic: true\n      injection_n_items: 200\n      clean_baseline_n_items: 500\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下semi-synthetic validation的核心是ΔTPR=+0.508 at p=0.5——这证明DIF能检测\n      known differential contamination(注入的ground truth)。dose-response单调性(从p=0.3到p=1.0\n      TPR单调上升)确认检测力与exploitation rate成正比，排除了random artifact。\n      baseline FPR=0.314反映temporal cohort的genuine item-level DIF(与plan_001的31.3%一致)，\n      而非false positives——这些\"false\" positives实际上是真实的temporal instability。\n      cross-subject matching的FPR stability(vs standard matching的inflation至0.616)\n      是Claim 3的关键贡献：matching variable contamination是subtle but critical methodological issue。\n      best档下这些数字完美支撑三贡献结构中的Claim 2(semi-synthetic proves DIF detects\n      what web-overlap labels cannot capture)和Claim 3(cross-subject matching as reusable infrastructure)。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Semi-Synthetic Detection Power (Cross-Subject Matching)\"\n        columns: [exploitation_rate_p, tpr, delta_tpr, fpr, fpr_inflation]\n        rows:\n          - [0.0 (baseline), 0.326, \"—\", 0.314, 0.000]\n          - [0.3, 0.548, +0.222, 0.314, 0.000]\n          - [0.5, 0.834, +0.508, 0.314, 0.000]\n          - [0.7, 0.990, +0.664, 0.314, 0.000]\n          - [1.0, 1.000, +0.674, 0.314, 0.000]\n      - name: \"Table: Matching Strategy Comparison at p=1.0\"\n        columns: [matching, tpr, fpr, delta_fpr_vs_baseline]\n        rows:\n          - [Standard (within-benchmark), 1.000, 0.616, +0.298]\n          - [Cross-subject (external), 1.000, 0.314, 0.000]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Dose-response curve — ΔTPR vs exploitation rate p, with 95% CI bands\"\n      - \"Fig: FPR comparison — standard vs cross-subject matching across injection levels\"\n    analysis: >\n      semi-synthetic validation是paper中load-bearing experiment之一。ΔTPR=+0.508是Claim 2\n      的empirical anchor：如果DIF只检测\"noise\"，注入known contamination不应提升TPR。\n      cross-subject matching的ΔFPR=0.000(5个subjects全部)是Claim 3的practical innovation proof。\n      best档下此实验与plan_016(within-subject semi-synthetic)共同构成semi-synthetic framework\n      的完整validation story。\n\n  - name: multi_benchmark_temporal_dif\n    plan_id: plan_028\n    description: >\n      METABENCH中额外benchmark(ARC-Challenge, HellaSwag, WinoGrande, TruthfulQA)的\n      temporal DIF分析，加上已完成的MMLU和GSM8K，共6个benchmark。\n    expected_results:\n      mmlu:\n        n_items: 12508\n        n_ref: 1080\n        n_foc: 807\n        pct_c: 31.3\n        random_pct_c: 0.18\n        bootstrap_ci_95: [29.38, 38.05]\n      winogrande:\n        n_items: 1267\n        n_ref: 1017\n        n_foc: 803\n        pct_c: 30.3\n        random_pct_c: 0.32\n      truthfulqa:\n        n_items: 817\n        n_ref: 1080\n        n_foc: 807\n        pct_c: 29.7\n        random_pct_c: 0.37\n      arc:\n        n_items: 1172\n        n_ref: 1080\n        n_foc: 807\n        pct_c: 26.9\n        random_pct_c: 0.60\n      gsm8k:\n        n_items: 1319\n        n_ref: 1017\n        n_foc: 804\n        pct_c: 18.9\n        random_pct_c: 0.30\n      hellaswag:\n        n_items: 10042\n        n_ref: 1080\n        n_foc: 807\n        pct_c: 17.9\n        random_pct_c: 0.28\n      cross_benchmark_range: \"17.9–31.3%\"\n      all_random_controls_below_1pct: true\n      min_enrichment_ratio_vs_random: 45\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下6 benchmark全部显示显著temporal DIF(17.9-31.3%)，所有random controls <1%。\n      C%的跨benchmark range反映benchmark结构差异：MMLU/WinoGrande/TruthfulQA(多domain/多题型)\n      的C%较高(29-31%)因为item heterogeneity提供更多DIF机会；\n      GSM8K/HellaSwag(单domain或特定task)较低(17-19%)因为items更同质，\n      differential functioning更多被ability matching吸收。\n      ARC(26.9%)居中。enrichment ratio(vs random)最低45×说明temporal DIF在所有benchmark\n      上都far above chance。best档下6-benchmark consistency是Claim 1 generalizability的核心证据，\n      直接回应\"only validated on MMLU\"的reviewer concern。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-Benchmark Temporal DIF Summary\"\n        columns: [benchmark, n_items, n_ref, n_foc, pct_c, random_pct_c, ratio]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU, 12508, 1080, 807, 31.3, 0.18, 174×]\n          - [WinoGrande, 1267, 1017, 803, 30.3, 0.32, 95×]\n          - [TruthfulQA, 817, 1080, 807, 29.7, 0.37, 80×]\n          - [ARC-Challenge, 1172, 1080, 807, 26.9, 0.60, 45×]\n          - [GSM8K, 1319, 1017, 804, 18.9, 0.30, 63×]\n          - [HellaSwag, 10042, 1080, 807, 17.9, 0.28, 64×]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Bar chart of C% across 6 benchmarks, with random control overlay and 95% bootstrap CIs\"\n    analysis: >\n      6-benchmark consistency(全部>15%、全部random<1%)是best档的strongest generalizability evidence。\n      range 17.9-31.3%在best档key metrics范围内(cross_benchmark_c_pct_min 17-20%, max 29-33%)。\n      此结果被审稿人视为充分跨benchmark证据，不需要additional benchmarks。\n\n  - name: permutation_null_c_rate\n    plan_id: plan_029\n    description: >\n      1000× permutation test：随机重分配2023/2024 temporal labels(保持group sizes N_ref=1080,\n      N_foc=807)，每次运行MH-DIF，建立C%的null distribution。\n    expected_results:\n      n_permutations: 1000\n      null_c_pct_mean: 0.21\n      null_c_pct_sd: 0.05\n      null_c_pct_max: 0.42\n      null_c_pct_p95: 0.30\n      null_c_pct_p99: 0.36\n      observed_c_pct: 31.3\n      permutation_p_value: \"<0.001\"\n      z_score_observed_vs_null: \">600\"\n      null_distribution_shape: \"approximately normal, centered near random-split control\"\n      consistency_with_random_split: true\n      random_split_c_pct: 0.18\n      computation_time_hours: 12\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下permutation null的mean C%=0.21%与within-cohort random split(0.18%)高度一致——\n      这是预期的，因为random label permutation破坏temporal信号后，MH-DIF只能检测到\n      random fluctuation，与random split在概率上等价。null C% max=0.42%说明1000次permutation\n      中最极端的case也远低于observed 31.3%。z>600意味着observed值在null distribution的\n      >600个标准差之外，permutation p<0.001(实际上是p<1/1000因为0/1000 permutations达到31.3%)。\n      best档下此结果直接回答\"is 31% above chance?\"——答案是overwhelming yes。\n      null distribution的near-normal shape和consistency with random split互相验证了两种\n      null estimation方法的正确性。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Permutation Null Distribution Summary\"\n        columns: [statistic, value]\n        rows:\n          - [Observed C%, 31.3]\n          - [Null mean C%, 0.21]\n          - [Null SD, 0.05]\n          - [Null max (1000 perms), 0.42]\n          - [Permutation p-value, \"<0.001\"]\n          - [z-score, \">600\"]\n          - [Random-split control C%, 0.18]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Null distribution histogram (1000 permutations) with observed 31.3% marked as vertical red line, far off-scale\"\n    analysis: >\n      Permutation null是Claim 1最直接的statistical significance evidence。\n      null mean 0.21%与random split 0.18%的一致性(差异0.03pp)说明两种null estimation converge。\n      observed 31.3%在null的>600σ之外——这不是marginal significance，而是absolute certainty\n      that temporal DIF is real。best档下审稿人无法质疑\"31% is chance level\"。\n      此实验落在best档key metrics范围内(permutation_null_c_pct [0.0, 1.0])。\n\n  - name: odds_ratio_regression_transparency\n    plan_id: plan_030\n    description: >\n      DIF flag的logistic regression透明度分析：odds ratio + 95% CI + 多种R²指标 + deviance ratio。\n      item-level finer-grained model (DIF flag ~ item-level accuracy change)补充domain-level分析。\n    expected_results:\n      model1_domain_delta:\n        mcfadden_r2: 0.0007\n        nagelkerke_r2: 0.0012\n        subject_acc_delta_or_per_010: 1.55\n        subject_acc_delta_ci_per_010: [1.19, 2.03]\n      model2_domain_delta_plus_items:\n        mcfadden_r2: 0.0423\n        nagelkerke_r2: 0.072\n        subject_acc_delta_or_per_010: 0.73\n        ctt_discrimination_or_per_010: 1.51\n      model3_item_delta:\n        mcfadden_r2: 0.0012\n        nagelkerke_r2: 0.0021\n        item_acc_change_or_per_010: 1.08\n        item_acc_change_ci: [1.51, 2.96]\n      model4_item_delta_plus_items:\n        mcfadden_r2: 0.0434\n        nagelkerke_r2: 0.0737\n        item_acc_change_or_per_010: 0.92\n        ctt_discrimination_or_per_010: 1.54\n      simpsons_paradox: true\n      lr_test_m1_vs_m2_chi2: 646.98\n      lr_test_m3_vs_m4_chi2: 655.53\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下四个模型的R²全部极低(<0.08)，这是core finding而非limitation：\n      accuracy change(无论domain-level还是item-level)解释DIF variance的能力极弱，\n      说明DIF捕获的是item-specific differential functioning而非aggregate accuracy improvement。\n      Simpson's paradox(Model 1中OR=1.55 per 0.10 accuracy change但Model 2/4中OR翻转至<1)\n      说明item properties(difficulty, discrimination)是confounders——controlling后accuracy change\n      的apparent effect消失甚至反转。best档下此结果是plan_019(decomposition: ≤2.4pp/7.6%)\n      的complementary evidence，用不同方法学(logistic regression vs item-level decomposition)\n      converge on same conclusion。discrimination OR=1.54最具信息量：high-discrimination items\n      更容易被flag为DIF-C，因为它们对ability差异更敏感，微小的cohort composition差异就能触发large |Δ_MH|。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Logistic Regression Models for DIF Flag Prediction\"\n        columns: [model, predictors, mcfadden_r2, nagelkerke_r2, key_or]\n        rows:\n          - [Model 1, subject_acc_Δ, 0.0007, 0.0012, \"1.55 [1.19,2.03]\"]\n          - [Model 2, subject_acc_Δ + item_props, 0.0423, 0.072, \"0.73 (reversed)\"]\n          - [Model 3, item_acc_Δ, 0.0012, 0.0021, \"1.08 [1.51,2.96]\"]\n          - [Model 4, item_acc_Δ + item_props, 0.0434, 0.0737, \"0.92 (reversed)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Simpson's paradox visualization — marginal vs conditional OR for accuracy change\"\n    analysis: >\n      Simpson's paradox是this experiment的signature finding。Model 1作为primary(conservative,\n      gives accuracy change its best shot at explaining DIF)，Model 2作为supplementary\n      (shows the paradox)。审稿人看到R²<0.001 for accuracy change alone即可确信\n      \"31% is not just models getting better\"。dual interpretation explicitly acknowledged in Discussion。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"6478f727-08b4-4009-a806-296c75160ef1","total_cost_usd":0.598553,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":23898,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":16972,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":23898,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":16972,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":23898,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":23898},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":18860,"outputTokens":20,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.018959999999999998,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":16972,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":23898,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.579593,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"fe8ce173-44c8-486f-bdd3-a1fd281ca02e"}
